#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.corr.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.corr"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr:1 of
msgid "Compute pairwise Pearson correlation of columns."
msgstr "计算列之间的成对 Pearson 相关系数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr:2 of
msgid ""
"Returns an N×N matrix via flat_apply, with a ``columns`` string "
"column as the row label (matching pandas' index).  When a data "
"column or group key is named ``columns``, the label probes to "
"``columns_1``, ``columns_2``, … to avoid collision.  The diagonal "
"is always 1.0."
msgstr ""
"通过 flat_apply 返回 N×N 矩阵，包含一个 ``columns`` 字符串列作为行标签"
"（与 pandas 的索引一致）。当数据列或组键名为 ``columns`` 时，"
"行标签会探测到 ``columns_1``、``columns_2``…以避免碰撞。"
"对角线始终为 1.0。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr:3 of
msgid ""
"Correlation is computed pairwise-complete: each pair (i, j) uses "
"only rows where both columns are non-null, matching pandas."
msgstr ""
"相关系数按成对完整方式计算：每对 (i, j) 仅使用两列都非空的行，与 pandas 一致。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr:4 of
msgid "Execution strategy.  ``'auto'`` selects based on data size."
msgstr "执行策略。``'auto'`` 根据数据大小进行选择。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr:5 of
msgid ""
"If True, only numeric columns are included.  If False (the pandas "
"2.0+ default), non-numeric columns cause a TypeError."
msgstr ""
"如果为 True，仅包含数值列。如果为 False（pandas 2.0+ 默认值），"
"非数值列会引发 TypeError。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr:6 of
msgid "Minimum non-null observations per pair; below this, NaN."
msgstr "每对非空观测值的最小数量；低于此值返回 NaN。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr:7 of
msgid "Delta degrees of freedom.  Divides by ``n - ddof``."
msgstr "自由度增量。除以 ``n - ddof``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr:8 of
msgid "Additional keyword arguments forwarded to the aggregation."
msgstr "转发给聚合的额外关键字参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr:9 of
msgid ""
"N×N matrix with a ``columns`` string column and one column per "
"numeric column."
msgstr "N×N 矩阵，包含一个 ``columns`` 字符串列和每个数值列一个列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.cov_corr.corr of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

